<title>USA: U.S. soybean oil trade -- Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean oil trade -- Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department</p>
<p>report of U.S. trade in soybean oil (tonnes):</p>
<p> -	    Exports   Imports</p>
<p> -  Jan 97   86,514    3,146</p>
<p> -  Dec 96   96,770    1,081</p>
<p> -  Jan 96   85,596   12,453</p>
<p>Note--Exports include crude, once and fully refined, washed, bleached or deodorized and wholly hydrogenated. Imports include crude, once refined and fully refined, and do not include pharmaceutical grade oil.</p>
</text>
